<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><a href="wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Image.jpg"><img class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-1067" alt="Image" src="wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Image.jpg" width="158" height="200" /></a></p>
