<p><a href="wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Image-2.jpg"><img class="aligncenter size-medium wp-image-1061" alt="Image 2" src="wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Image-2-224x300.jpg" width="224" height="300" /></a></p>
